# Third-party notices: Rust crates

The Astroshots Rust crates (`astroshot`, `astroshot-engine`,
`astroshot-review`) are MIT licensed (see `LICENSE` in the repository root).
Binaries built from them include the third-party crates, fonts and npm
packages below. Each crate is listed with its declared license; the license
texts that follow name the crates each one is used for.

Generated by [cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) from
`rust/Cargo.lock`, `rust/about.toml` and `rust/about.hbs`, then extended by
`scripts/third-party-notices.mjs`. Do not edit by hand; run `npm run notices`
after changing dependencies.

